  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="18b">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 18b</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ac we ðonne sceolon habban anfeald lean ðæs ðe we on life ær geworhton; wa ðam ðonne ðe ær geærnode hellewíte!</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">But we shall then receive simply the reward for what we have done in our lifetime. Woe then to him who has earned the torment of hell.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ac þonne we sceolan habban anfeald lean ðæs þe we on life ær geworhtan; wá þam þonne, þe ær geearnode hellewite!</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
